Third-party origins
===================

src/core/e2sysex.ts, src/core/hacktribeNrpn.ts, src/core/e2FxParams.ts,
src/core/hacktribeRam.ts, src/core/e2FxPreset.ts
----------------------------------------------------------------------
The KORG Electribe 2 SysEx protocol implementation and the KORG 8-bit <-> 7-bit
codec are ported from:

    hacktribe / hacktribe-editor / hacktribe-editor-legacy
    Copyright (C) bangcorrupt
    https://github.com/bangcorrupt/hacktribe
